# BreakBuddy does not require any environment variables for the V1 MVP —
# there is no backend and no third-party API keys (see product/PRD.md,
# section 21 "Data Storage" and section 40 "Security & Privacy").
#
# This file exists as a placeholder for when a real backend (e.g.
# Supabase, for syncing settings/progress across devices) is introduced
# in a future version. Copy it to .env.local and fill in real values
# when that day comes — never commit .env.local.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
